 "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn8le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:\t\tHey, V! Did you hear that Peter got in touch with Camilla? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tHe should've done it a while ago! Don't you think that her crush on him was impossible to miss?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:\t\tI know, but that's Peter we're talking about! She must've felt like he didn't care about her. Peter can be quite dopey sometimes.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tWell, at least his love life seems to be getting somewhere. Maybe I should follow in his footsteps.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn8le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:\t\tI would spend less time at the restaurant if I were you ...<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tHow am I supposed to do that! Being the manager of a trendy place takes a toll on your social life. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:\t\tYou might be right ... You don't think you should take a step back perhaps?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tThe only way I could do that would be if I hired an assistant manager. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:\t\tThat sounds like a sensible idea! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tI've been thinking about this. I'm supposed to interview a few applicants next week.", "id": 2, "time": "21200", "image": "engenn8le01ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:\t\tYou don't sound convinced. What's stopping you?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tYou know me! I like to control every aspect of the restaurant!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:\t\tWell, if you want to start meeting new people, don't you think you should come to a compromise?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tYou might be right about that. I guess I could let go of my controlling habits ...<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tThat would be a good place to start!", "id": 3, "time": "46000", "image": "engenn8le01ob09re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le01ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}